# Hotel Search API Configuration
# This file shows example environment variables needed for real API integration

# Amadeus Hotel Search API (Recommended)
# Get your API keys from: https://developers.amadeus.com/
# AMADEUS_API_KEY=your_amadeus_api_key_here
# AMADEUS_API_SECRET=your_amadeus_api_secret_here

# RapidAPI Hotels.com Integration (Alternative)
# Get your API key from: https://rapidapi.com/apidojo/api/hotels4/
# RAPIDAPI_KEY=your_rapidapi_key_here

# Google Hotels API (Alternative - if using)
# Get your API key from: https://developers.google.com/maps
# NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_HOTELS_API_KEY=your_google_api_key_here

# ============================================
# FLIGHT SEARCH API CONFIGURATION
# ============================================

# AviationStack API (Primary Flight Provider)
# Get your API key from: https://aviationstack.com/
AVIATIONSTACK_API_KEY=your_aviationstack_key_here

# SerpAPI for Google Flights (Alternative / Fallback)
# Get your API key from: https://serpapi.com/
SERPAPI_API_KEY=your_serpapi_key_here


# Flight Search Strategy:
# - Both APIs are called in parallel for maximum flight options
# - Results are merged and deduplicated automatically
# - If one API fails, the other serves as automatic fallback
# - No error messages shown to users for seamless experience

# Current Status: Using Mock Data
# The hotel search feature currently uses mock data for demonstration.
# To enable real API integration:
# 1. Choose one of the APIs above
# 2. Get your credentials
# 3. Add the credentials to your .env.local file (NOT checked into git)
# 4. Uncomment and implement the API call in src/services/hotelService.ts

# ============================================
# AI PLANNER & CHAT API CONFIGURATION
# ============================================
# Groq API (Recommended - Free & Ultra Fast)
# Get your API key from: https://console.groq.com/keys
GROQ_API_KEY=your_groq_api_key_here
# Optional model override (defaults to llama-3.3-70b-versatile)
# GROQ_MODEL=llama-3.3-70b-versatile

# OpenAI API (Alternative)
# Get your API key from: https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
# OPENAI_API_KEY=your_openai_api_key_here

# ============================================
# MAPBOX 3D WORLD MAP & DIRECTIONS API
# ============================================
# Mapbox Public Access Token (Get key from https://account.mapbox.com/access-tokens/)
# Starts with pk.eyJ...
NEXT_PUBLIC_MAPBOX_ACCESS_TOKEN=your_mapbox_token_here

# ============================================
# UPSTASH REDIS RATE LIMITING
# ============================================
# Upstash REST URL and Token from: https://console.upstash.com/
# Used to rate limit AI chat (5/hr) and flight searches (30/hr)
UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_URL=your_upstash_redis_rest_url_here
UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_TOKEN=your_upstash_redis_rest_token_here
